 et al., Nutrients, 2019"}, {"type": "text", "id": "rr_i3_link", "label": "Study link", "default": "https://www.mdpi.com/2072-6643/11/10/2362"}, {"type": "header", "content": "Study 4"}, {"type": "text", "id": "rr_i4_name", "label": "Ingredient", "default": "B vitamins"}, {"type": "textarea", "id": "rr_i4_text", "label": "Finding", "default": "B6, B12 and folic acid, at the amounts in Cognition, slowed the rate of brain shrinkage over two years in older adults with mild memory decline.*"}, {"type": "text", "id": "rr_i4_cite", "label": "Citation", "default": "Smith et al., PLoS One, 2010"}, {"type": "text", "id": "rr_i4_link", "label": "Study link", "default": "https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0012244"}, {"type": "header", "content": "Study 5 (optional)"}, {"type": "text", "id": "rr_i5_name", "label": "Ingredient", "info": "Optional. Leave empty to hide this row."}, {"type": "textarea", "id": "rr_i5_text", "label": "Finding"}, {"type": "text", "id": "rr_i5_cite", "label": "Citation"}, {"type": "text", "id": "rr_i5_link", "label": "Study link"}, {"type": "textarea", "id": "rr_note", "label": "Disclaimer", "default": "Studies tested each ingredient on its own, not the Cognition formula. *These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."}, {"type": "header", "content": "Image card"}, {"type": "image_picker", "id": "rr_image", "label": "Image"}, {"type": "text", "id": "rr_card_title", "label": "Card title", "default": "Matched to the research"}, {"type": "textarea", "id": "rr_card_text", "label": "Card text", "default": "The B6, B12 and folate in Cognition match the daily amounts used in the University of Oxford’s VITACOG trial."}, {"type": "header", "content": "Button"}, {"type": "text", "id": "rr_btn", "label": "Button label", "default": "The science behind it"}, {"type": "text", "id": "rr_btn_link", "label": "Button link", "default": "/pages/science"}], "presets": [{"name": "Research"}]}{% endschema %}
